desc:
🚢 The Long Way Home 🏝️
A peaceful voyage turns into a fight for survival.

After a massive storm destroys your ship, you wake up stranded on a mysterious island far from home. To return, you must journey across the island, exploring multiple biomes, gathering resources and ores, crafting tools, weapons, and gear, and battling dangerous enemies and powerful bosses that block your path.

Each biome brings new challenges, stronger foes, and better loot. Progress carefully, upgrade your equipment, and prove your strength as the island tests how far you’re willing to go to make it back.

Will you survive the island… and make it back?

